  unitName: Hermit Talos
  unitId: 10181
  unitNumber: 459
  description: A mysterious old man thought to be a hermit living in the area around
    the La Veda Republic. Though he was a troubled man who enjoyed messing with travelers,
    it is said that he used his fire techniques to save his neighbors from monster
    attacks, and also gave away medicine when diseases had spread. Records have been
    found of him being taken in by nuns here and there, but his absurdly long life
    suggested by the length of time over which these events occured has many historical
    scholars worried.
  summonDesc: Break my curse and<br>I'll become a beautiful girl.<br>He he, I kid,
    I kid.
  fusionDesc: Hmph, so this is fusion?<br>This is the first time I've<br>seen it.
